 "extension": {
  "lang": "EN",
  "description": "<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This dataset shows the contributions of individual goods and services to the annual rate of change for the euro area. Their impact on the inflation rate is measured in percentage points.&nbsp;This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification of Individual Consumption According to Purpose (ECOICOP) ver. 2.</p>",
